## Generated output

Files written into another repository by `bin/skeletor-new` — the contents of
`template/`, with placeholders substituted — are not subject to the notice
requirement above.

SKYROW LABS LLC places no conditions on scaffolded output. It is yours: license
it, relicense it, modify it, sell it or keep it private, with no attribution to
skeletor required and no notice to carry.

This clarifies the grant above rather than narrowing it, and it is here because
skeletor exists to produce a repository that belongs to whoever ran it. A
scaffolding tool whose output dragged its own copyright notice into every
project would be one nobody could use for the thing it is for.
